<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman starts Premier Oil.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lehman starts Premier Oil.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier Oil Plc was rated &quot;outperform&quot; as Lehman Brothers started coverage of the stock, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Lehman said the company had a moderate risk, medium-term drilling programme, the most attractive valuation in the sector and a series of promising &quot;crown jewel&quot; international exploration projects.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
